                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A homosexual woman, one who is exclusively sexually or romantically attracted to other women."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84738407-c0c7-43e8-a823-5b2cc404fb2e",
                                                "sense_id": "e5b47e73-8118-30b7-80fe-9db67e8e0db3",
                                                "text": "There have also been women who loved other women. These are the Lesbians or Tribades."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f781f1f-d06c-45c8-931b-989d4c7707f2",
                                                "sense_id": "e5b47e73-8118-30b7-80fe-9db67e8e0db3",
                                                "text": "Another Spanish-speaking respondent said that she does not identify as a lesbian because that is a term for women who like women, and as she does not like women, and so she cannot be a lesbian."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b39ed685-3404-3933-bb41-cfb7d0aff7f0",
                                        "entry_id": "3df998d4-41e9-3a08-83cd-aad5e80e1ff1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female animal that performs courtship, pairing or mating behavior with other female animals."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncommon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf70272f-f2fa-47e6-a8a4-cd067c905978",
                                                "sense_id": "b39ed685-3404-3933-bb41-cfb7d0aff7f0",
                                                "text": "There was one recently that determined on an island off California 14 percent of the female sea gulls were lesbians (and we know that kind of thing would never go among Nantucket sea gulls)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1909e88-d309-4e6a-a175-89c418f6e56f",
                                                "sense_id": "b39ed685-3404-3933-bb41-cfb7d0aff7f0",
                                                "text": "The only between this pair and others in the community is that they are among the 8 to 14 percent of the residents that are lesbians. After building their nest, the pair, two female western gulls, customarily produce twice as many eggs […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
